    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bits and Boards puts you behind the counter of a bustling neighbourhood game store.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be in charge of everything that happens on, under, and after that counter. Stock the latest hits, charm every customer, and expand your thriving business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Shop</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep shelves filled with the board-game classics, hot new TCG boosters, retro consoles, and quirky indie gems. Use daily sales data and seasonal trends to decide what\u2014and how much\u2014to reorder before popular items run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hire Staff &amp; Automate</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cashiers speed up the queue, restock workers keep your shelves full and storage workers keep your boxes tidy. The right team lets the shop hum along even during peak hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfy Every Customer\u00a0\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoppers walk in with budgets, wish-lists, and comfort needs. Meet (or miss) those requirements and they\u2019ll leave glowing (or scathing) reviews that directly affect your store\u2019s reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand &amp; Upgrade</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Profits unlock new floor space, furniture, decorations and a variety or items to display in your shop. Each upgrade opens fresh mechanics and passive buffs to boost your store\u2019s performance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>Level Up &amp; Perk Up!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your store earns profits, it will level up and grant perk points. Spend these points to unlock powerful passive bonuses or brand-new features for your shop!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bits and Boards puts you behind the counter of a bustling neighbourhood game store.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be in charge of everything that happens on, under, and after that counter. Stock the latest hits, charm every customer, and expand your thriving business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Shop</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep shelves filled with the board-game classics, hot new TCG boosters, retro consoles, and quirky indie gems. Use daily sales data and seasonal trends to decide what\u2014and how much\u2014to reorder before popular items run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hire Staff &amp; Automate</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cashiers speed up the queue, restock workers keep your shelves full and storage workers keep your boxes tidy. The right team lets the shop hum along even during peak hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfy Every Customer\u00a0\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoppers walk in with budgets, wish-lists, and comfort needs. Meet (or miss) those requirements and they\u2019ll leave glowing (or scathing) reviews that directly affect your store\u2019s reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand &amp; Upgrade</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Profits unlock new floor space, furniture, decorations and a variety or items to display in your shop. Each upgrade opens fresh mechanics and passive buffs to boost your store\u2019s performance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>Level Up &amp; Perk Up!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your store earns profits, it will level up and grant perk points. Spend these points to unlock powerful passive bonuses or brand-new features for your shop!</p>",
